2
00:01:04.167 --> 00:01:06.000
Five hundred years ago

3
00:01:07.667 --> 00:01:08.875
in Yongzhou

4
00:01:10.417 --> 00:01:12.708
the young snake-catcher A Xuan

5
00:01:13.042 --> 00:01:16.458
saved a white snake in a young woman's form

6
00:01:18.500 --> 00:01:20.375
by giving up his own life.

7
00:01:23.667 --> 00:01:25.750
Five hundred years passed.

8
00:01:27.542 --> 00:01:30.042
Now it's the Song dynasty.

9
00:02:05.750 --> 00:02:07.708
Wherever he is.

10
00:02:09.625 --> 00:02:11.333
whatever he's like.

11
00:02:13.375 --> 00:02:15.375
whether or not he remembers me.

12
00:02:16.833 --> 00:02:18.333
I have to find him.

13
00:02:19.417 --> 00:02:21.333
We are free!

14
00:02:22.792 --> 00:02:24.042
I'll be back.

15
00:02:24.583 --> 00:02:25.583
Wait for me.

16
00:02:28.417 --> 00:02:29.417
Because”.

17
00:02:30.625 --> 00:02:31.625
I remember.

18
00:02:39.583 --> 00:02:40.583
Sister-

19
00:02:41.958 --> 00:02:42.958
see these mountains?

20
00:02:43.250 --> 00:02:44.476
These stones?

21
00:02:44.500 --> 00:02:45.750
They haven't changed.

22
00:02:46.417 --> 00:02:47.768
But the people of the village

23
00:02:47.792 --> 00:02:48.833
are all gone.

24
00:02:50.292 --> 00:02:51.583
To attain immortality

25
00:02:51.833 --> 00:02:53.667
we practiced for hundreds of years.

26
00:02:54.792 --> 00:02:56.476
At last we see the fruits of that.

27
00:02:56.500 --> 00:02:57.958
You want to throw it all away?

28
00:03:00.250 --> 00:03:01.250
Verta!

29
00:03:02.875 --> 00:03:04.000
Say you find him.

30
00:03:04.500 --> 00:03:05.958
How long can you be together?

31
00:03:19.375 --> 00:03:20.458
Verta-

32
00:03:22.500 --> 00:03:23.500
Verta-

33
00:03:23.792 --> 00:03:24.917
you're right.

34
00:03:25.500 --> 00:03:26.958
Human life is like dew.

35
00:03:27.167 --> 00:03:28.667
It lasts but a moment.

36
00:03:29.958 --> 00:03:31.292
It's for that reason

37
00:03:31.750 --> 00:03:33.059
I want to find him.

38
00:03:33.083 --> 00:03:35.208
To repay his kindness.

39
00:03:37.625 --> 00:03:38.833
When he passes.

40
00:03:39.417 --> 00:03:40.542
I'll have done that

41
00:03:40.875 --> 00:03:43.292
and can move on from this obsession!

42
00:03:44.208 --> 00:03:45.185
Then

43
00:03:45.209 --> 00:03:47.875
we can return to our self-cultivation.

44
00:03:50.500 --> 00:03:51.500
Verta?

45
00:03:55.875 --> 00:03:56.875
Verta?

46
00:04:15.458 --> 00:04:19.750
White Snake: Afloat

47
00:04:30.583 --> 00:04:33.601
Lantern Festival

48
00:04:33.625 --> 00:04:34.393
Lantern Festival Miss!

49
00:04:34.417 --> 00:04:35.417
Lantern Festival

50
00:04:37.250 --> 00:04:38.250
Miss!

51
00:04:40.875 --> 00:04:41.500
Miss-

52
00:04:41.833 --> 00:04:42.917
you dropped your hairpin!

53
00:04:54.750 --> 00:04:56.042
Thank you. young sir.

54
00:05:11.583 --> 00:05:12.684
This hairpin

55
00:05:12.708 --> 00:05:14.583
looks quite precious.

56
00:05:15.167 --> 00:05:15.958
It is.

57
00:05:16.167 --> 00:05:17.542
Thank you for finding it.

58
00:05:17.875 --> 00:05:19.792
We mustn't ever lose it.

59
00:05:24.417 --> 00:05:26.518
You seem familiar. Miss.

60
00:05:26.542 --> 00:05:27.875
Where are you from?

61
00:05:29.458 --> 00:05:30.625
It's a long story.

62
00:05:32.208 --> 00:05:33.518
But young sir-

63
00:05:33.542 --> 00:05:34.809
what is your name?

64
00:05:34.833 --> 00:05:36.083
Where are you from?

65
00:05:36.375 --> 00:05:37.684
My surname is Xu

66
00:05:37.708 --> 00:05:38.708
and my given name Xian.

67
00:05:38.958 --> 00:05:39.958
I'm from Lin'an.

68
00:05:40.958 --> 00:05:43.083
You're called Xu Xian.

69
00:05:43.958 --> 00:05:44.958
Yes...

70
00:05:45.667 --> 00:05:46.976
Dr Xu!

71
00:05:47.000 --> 00:05:48.476
I sent for you urgently.

72
00:05:48.500 --> 00:05:56.500
And you're here chatting?
- See you. Dr Xu! Take care!

73
00:18:47.000 --> 00:18:48.000
You know-

74
00:18:48.542 --> 00:18:49.667
My brother-in-law

75
00:18:49.917 --> 00:18:52.083
was just a kid when I met him.

76
00:18:52.708 --> 00:18:54.667
Now that he's married

77
00:18:55.250 --> 00:18:57.625
and to such a great woman-

78
00:19:00.917 --> 00:19:03.768
I've done my duty to his sister.

79
00:19:03.792 --> 00:19:04.958
It's true.

80
00:19:05.333 --> 00:19:07.059
For such a bride to appear out of nowhere

81
00:19:07.083 --> 00:19:08.792
is so lucky it's almost spooky.

82
00:19:09.083 --> 00:19:10.458
Let's go.

83
00:19:10.917 --> 00:19:13.708
The wedding night is a golden time!

84
00:19:33.792 --> 00:19:34.792
Husband.

85
00:19:36.208 --> 00:19:37.208
Beloved.

86
00:19:49.833 --> 00:19:53.208
Red threads bind. together forever.

87
00:19:53.833 --> 00:19:57.167
Marital bliss. joy everlasting.

88
00:19:58.167 --> 00:19:59.792
Life is a dream

89
00:20:00.292 --> 00:20:01.583
and a lifetime like dew.

90
00:20:02.250 --> 00:20:05.250
Seas might dry and stones decay

91
00:20:05.833 --> 00:20:07.333
but our love is eternal.

92
00:20:08.458 --> 00:20:10.250
This I solemnly swear.

93
00:20:48.042 --> 00:20:48.934
The demons are coming!

94
00:20:48.958 --> 00:20:49.958
I'm a demon.

95
00:20:50.667 --> 00:20:52.976
Being with me can only hurt you.

96
00:20:53.000 --> 00:20:53.708
Blanca!

97
00:20:53.958 --> 00:20:55.625
A Xuan!

98
00:21:07.792 --> 00:21:09.184
That jade hairpin-

99
00:21:09.208 --> 00:21:10.458
good idea to bury it.

100
00:21:11.000 --> 00:21:12.000
Verta!

101
00:21:12.583 --> 00:21:13.583
You're here?

102
00:21:14.250 --> 00:21:15.875
I've been here all night.

103
00:21:16.250 --> 00:21:18.893
A fresh breeze and nature for a bed.

104
00:21:18.917 --> 00:21:20.167
I love it.

105
00:21:21.542 --> 00:21:23.792
But it's your wedding night.

106
00:21:24.042 --> 00:21:25.750
What are you doing up so early?

107
00:21:26.917 --> 00:21:28.333
I was just making a vow

108
00:21:28.667 --> 00:21:31.250
to be a devoted wife and forgo the magic arts.

109
00:21:32.000 --> 00:21:34.042
Let's keep away from the spirit world

110
00:21:34.708 --> 00:21:36.375
and live peacefully with people

111
00:21:36.583 --> 00:21:37.958
peacefully for one lifetime.

112
00:21:40.500 --> 00:21:42.583
The magic arts weren't easy to master.

113
00:21:43.292 --> 00:21:44.393
You can forgo them

114
00:21:44.417 --> 00:21:45.833
but I'll still use them.

115
00:21:52.208 --> 00:21:53.208
Verta-

116
00:21:53.250 --> 00:21:54.292
just one request.

117
00:21:54.583 --> 00:21:56.059
Please don't make trouble.

118
00:21:56.083 --> 00:21:57.184
Sister-

119
00:21:57.208 --> 00:21:58.667
must you do this?

120
00:21:59.250 --> 00:22:00.750
Use a little magic

121
00:22:00.958 --> 00:22:03.184
and jewels. good land and a nice house

122
00:22:03.208 --> 00:22:04.417
could be yours.

123
00:22:04.792 --> 00:22:07.542
Why live a hard life in this shabby place?

124
00:22:09.833 --> 00:22:10.833
Sister-

125
00:22:11.208 --> 00:22:12.958
magic is exciting in the moment.

126
00:22:13.500 --> 00:22:15.083
But doesn't it always lead us

127
00:22:15.583 --> 00:22:17.333
into terrible trouble?

128
00:22:20.792 --> 00:22:21.792
Sister-

129
00:22:23.458 --> 00:22:24.643
You finally got your wish

130
00:22:24.667 --> 00:22:26.250
and married him.

131
00:22:26.958 --> 00:22:28.292
But this Xu Xian-

132
00:22:28.708 --> 00:22:30.792
is he really A Xuan's reincarnation?

133
00:22:31.667 --> 00:22:32.667
Yes.

134
00:22:36.208 --> 00:22:37.060
So for this guy

135
00:22:37.084 --> 00:22:38.583
you cut off the road to immortality.

136
00:22:38.958 --> 00:22:39.958
Is it worth it?

137
00:22:42.458 --> 00:22:43.458
It is.

138
00:22:49.500 --> 00:22:50.500
Don't run!

139
00:22:51.292 --> 00:22:52.292
Stand still.

140
00:22:54.417 --> 00:22:55.417
Stand still.

141
00:23:17.958 --> 00:23:18.958
Xian!

142
00:23:41.458 --> 00:23:42.227
Cold Food Festival

143
00:23:42.251 --> 00:23:44.476
Cold Food Festival
Get your mugwort cakes!

144
00:23:44.500 --> 00:23:44.684
Cold Food Festival

145
00:23:44.708 --> 00:23:45.310
Cold Food Festival
Cold Food Festival! Mugwort cakes!

146
00:23:45.334 --> 00:23:48.208
Cold Food Festival! Mugwort cakes!

147
00:23:48.500 --> 00:23:52.083
Green as jade. soft as cotton.

148
00:23:52.792 --> 00:23:54.708
Get your mugwort cakes!

149
00:23:55.167 --> 00:23:57.476
Hey. you lovebirds-

150
00:23:57.500 --> 00:23:59.250
shall we get some mugwort cakes?

151
00:23:59.958 --> 00:24:03.226
Green as jade. soft as cotton.

152
00:24:03.250 --> 00:24:04.250
Verta!

153
00:24:06.000 --> 00:24:07.333
You'll tip the boat over!

154
00:24:16.250 --> 00:24:17.893
Dr Xu. you're back at last!

155
00:24:17.917 --> 00:24:19.518
My wife is vomiting and has the runs.

156
00:24:19.542 --> 00:24:21.476
Many people have the same thing!

157
00:24:21.500 --> 00:24:23.417
Dr Xu. quick. have a look.

158
00:24:25.083 --> 00:24:26.976
My wife has it too.

159
00:24:27.000 --> 00:24:28.101
She just fainted.

160
00:24:28.125 --> 00:24:29.125
Let me see.

161
00:24:30.458 --> 00:24:31.458
Help her inside.

162
00:24:31.917 --> 00:24:32.852
I'll revive her with acupuncture.

163
00:24:32.876 --> 00:24:35.792
Philtrum. fingertips. crown.

164
00:24:41.958 --> 00:24:42.958
She's awake!

165
00:24:44.417 --> 00:24:45.809
Everyone. stay calm.

166
00:24:45.833 --> 00:24:47.000
Tell me the symptoms.

167
00:24:53.083 --> 00:24:54.833
This epidemic has been so sudden.

168
00:24:55.292 --> 00:24:57.476
None of the clinics can help.

169
00:24:57.500 --> 00:24:59.000
There seems to be no cure.

170
00:25:00.750 --> 00:25:03.583
But the medicine you give them-

171
00:25:03.792 --> 00:25:06.125
isn't it making them better?

172
00:25:06.250 --> 00:25:08.059
Blanca. this prescription

173
00:25:08.083 --> 00:25:10.434
uses many pricey herbs

174
00:25:10.458 --> 00:25:11.458
and is long term.

175
00:25:11.708 --> 00:25:13.792
How can ordinary people afford it?

176
00:25:14.167 --> 00:25:17.042
The herb shops keep raising prices.

177
00:25:18.250 --> 00:25:19.917
That's so hateful.

178
00:25:20.458 --> 00:25:21.643
Those pharmacies

179
00:25:21.667 --> 00:25:23.333
only care about higher profits.

180
00:25:23.708 --> 00:25:25.228
They don't care if people live or die.

181
00:25:29.292 --> 00:25:31.167
What if we opened a pharmacy?

182
00:25:33.083 --> 00:25:35.393
But... it's not like being a doctor.

183
00:25:35.417 --> 00:25:36.750
You need capital.

184
00:25:42.500 --> 00:25:43.780
The prescription needs tweaking.

185
00:25:47.000 --> 00:25:49.292
This plague is so strange.

186
00:25:49.792 --> 00:25:52.542
Li says they can't work out its origin.

187
00:25:54.125 --> 00:25:55.125
Sister!

188
00:25:55.750 --> 00:26:00.208
Dry spell. watch your candles!

189
00:26:04.917 --> 00:26:06.750
Sister. just as you thought-

190
00:26:07.500 --> 00:26:09.268
the plague moves west to east.

191
00:26:09.292 --> 00:26:11.333
Case by case. it travels a straight line.

192
00:26:11.583 --> 00:26:12.934
It's not natural.

193
00:26:12.958 --> 00:26:14.018
Someone in this city

194
00:26:14.042 --> 00:26:15.282
is poisoning people on purpose.

195
00:26:17.500 --> 00:26:19.934
For poisoning. well water

196
00:26:19.958 --> 00:26:21.750
is most convenient.

197
00:26:27.750 --> 00:26:29.208
What a foul odor!

198
00:26:29.917 --> 00:26:30.477
This well

199
00:26:30.501 --> 00:26:32.476
has just been poisoned.

200
00:26:32.500 --> 00:26:34.726
Sadly. I got here a moment too late

201
00:26:34.750 --> 00:26:36.125
so failed to catch them.

202
00:26:37.333 --> 00:26:39.000
Heading east...

203
00:26:39.250 --> 00:26:40.542
which is the next well?

204
00:26:41.833 --> 00:26:44.250
Four-Eyed Well at South Star Bridge.

205
00:26:46.208 --> 00:26:50.268
An old Daoist in rustic robes

206
00:26:50.292 --> 00:26:54.934
Gourd on back. cloth on head

207
00:26:54.958 --> 00:26:58.559
Straw sandals. cloth socks. a humble man

208
00:26:58.583 --> 00:27:01.184
Fix your lute? Cure your ills? Yes. I can!

209
00:27:01.208 --> 00:27:02.518
Master. please wait!

210
00:27:02.542 --> 00:27:03.726
People say that this plague

211
00:27:03.750 --> 00:27:05.667
can only be cured by your pills.

212
00:27:06.167 --> 00:27:07.167
This way.

213
00:27:07.500 --> 00:27:08.227
We're begging you. sir!

214
00:27:08.251 --> 00:27:10.018
Today I've sold out of pills.

215
00:27:10.042 --> 00:27:11.518
Not one left.

216
00:27:11.542 --> 00:27:13.833
Tomorrow morning. East Gate Water Market.

217
00:27:14.250 --> 00:27:15.351
Be early. Wait for me there.

218
00:27:15.375 --> 00:27:16.393
Thank you. Master.

219
00:27:16.417 --> 00:27:20.375
Bust a ghost. catch a demon

220
00:27:20.792 --> 00:27:25.958
Up willow-fringed lanes I stroll.

221
00:27:37.917 --> 00:27:40.226
This well was just poisoned.

222
00:27:40.250 --> 00:27:42.542
Maybe it was that travelling Daoist...

223
00:27:42.958 --> 00:27:44.083
Rat demon!

224
00:27:48.000 --> 00:27:50.643
1.000 cash a pop. so expensive!

225
00:27:50.667 --> 00:27:52.917
It's a miracle cure. Be quiet.

226
00:27:53.375 --> 00:27:55.726
Master. please open shop!

227
00:27:55.750 --> 00:27:57.333
My family is dying.

228
00:28:00.917 --> 00:28:02.309
The master is here!

229
00:28:02.333 --> 00:28:03.809
We're saved!

230
00:28:03.833 --> 00:28:06.500
Medicine for sale!

231
00:28:06.583 --> 00:28:07.833
Master! I need a pill!

232
00:28:10.333 --> 00:28:11.518
This rat demon

233
00:28:11.542 --> 00:28:13.958
poisons the wells and sells the antidote.

234
00:28:15.250 --> 00:28:17.625
Let's punish that little demon!

235
00:28:20.417 --> 00:28:22.500
Sister. will you use your powers?

236
00:28:24.000 --> 00:28:26.708
No worries. I'll take care of it.

237
00:28:27.042 --> 00:28:30.375
You distract him. and watch me.

238
00:28:32.500 --> 00:28:33.394
Sister-

239
00:28:33.418 --> 00:28:34.559
you think you can just be

240
00:28:34.583 --> 00:28:36.250
an ordinary mortal woman.

241
00:28:36.667 --> 00:28:38.268
But in an emergency

242
00:28:38.292 --> 00:28:40.333
how can you not use your powers?

243
00:28:45.417 --> 00:28:49.750
Magic herbs. a guaranteed cure!

244
00:28:52.125 --> 00:28:54.750
Pay up!

245
00:28:55.250 --> 00:28:59.083
Bad stuff happens on a roll

246
00:29:04.042 --> 00:29:07.917
Bad men one day pay the toll

247
00:29:19.042 --> 00:29:20.250
A warning-

248
00:29:20.667 --> 00:29:24.500
patch the hull before the boat sails.

249
00:29:32.958 --> 00:29:35.417
That's it for today. closing shop.

250
00:29:59.583 --> 00:30:01.417
These pills are quite unusual.

251
00:30:01.750 --> 00:30:03.184
They use a herb

252
00:30:03.208 --> 00:30:04.417
that tastes familiar.

253
00:30:04.708 --> 00:30:06.417
But I can't think what it is.

254
00:30:07.958 --> 00:30:09.000
Thank you. Beloved.

255
00:30:09.250 --> 00:30:10.185
for all you've done.

256
00:30:10.209 --> 00:30:11.958
You're so compassionate.

257
00:30:15.667 --> 00:30:17.184
Didn't you say just now

258
00:30:17.208 --> 00:30:18.226
that to open a pharmacy

259
00:30:18.250 --> 00:30:19.833
we need more money?

260
00:30:20.292 --> 00:30:21.333
Blanca. look-

261
00:30:21.667 --> 00:30:23.018
Shop. herbs...

262
00:30:23.042 --> 00:30:24.542
I've done the sums.

263
00:30:24.667 --> 00:30:25.684
If we don't hire help

264
00:30:25.708 --> 00:30:27.393
and run it ourselves

265
00:30:27.417 --> 00:30:28.976
we'll still need

266
00:30:29.000 --> 00:30:31.583
another 100 taels of silver.

267
00:30:32.667 --> 00:30:35.542
Buy only official salt and wine.

268
00:30:35.833 --> 00:30:38.184
Smuggle and risk a fine.

269
00:30:38.208 --> 00:30:39.250
Silver...

270
00:30:39.708 --> 00:30:42.625
The magistrate's office has plenty of that.

271
00:30:45.042 --> 00:30:46.750
Everyone. look sharp!

272
00:31:34.958 --> 00:31:36.125
Careful with that!

273
00:31:36.333 --> 00:31:37.976
Dr Xu. your medicine cabinet!

274
00:31:38.000 --> 00:31:39.434
Thank you! Just put it inside.

275
00:31:39.458 --> 00:31:41.226
Dr Xu. where do we put the herbs?

276
00:31:41.250 --> 00:31:41.976
On the counter.

277
00:31:42.000 --> 00:31:42.684
Thank you!

278
00:31:42.708 --> 00:31:43.708
Dr Xu-

279
00:31:45.333 --> 00:31:46.934
where does the acupuncture model go?

280
00:31:46.958 --> 00:31:47.976
Let me!

281
00:31:48.000 --> 00:31:49.393
Dr Xu. don't-

282
00:31:49.417 --> 00:31:50.417
let us do it.

283
00:31:50.542 --> 00:31:51.583
Don't hurt your back.

284
00:31:52.250 --> 00:31:54.559
Miss Blanca. where do you want these?

285
00:31:54.583 --> 00:31:55.268
In the corner.

286
00:31:55.292 --> 00:31:55.727
Sure.

287
00:31:55.751 --> 00:31:56.893
Miss Blanca. and this?

288
00:31:56.917 --> 00:31:57.643
Over there.

289
00:31:57.667 --> 00:31:58.667
Thank you so much!

290
00:32:00.333 --> 00:32:01.976
Money makes the wheels go round.

291
