00:50:10.542 --> 00:50:12.250
I suddenly felt dizzy.

584
00:50:12.458 --> 00:50:13.060
Here.

585
00:50:13.084 --> 00:50:14.333
I'll check your pulse.

586
00:50:22.833 --> 00:50:23.476
Sister-

587
00:50:23.500 --> 00:50:24.309
he brought this home.

588
00:50:24.333 --> 00:50:24.958
What?

589
00:50:25.208 --> 00:50:25.935
Xian-

590
00:50:25.959 --> 00:50:27.708
take this pulse too.

591
00:50:40.750 --> 00:50:41.560
Blanca-

592
00:50:41.584 --> 00:50:43.083
Did this just begin today?

593
00:50:48.042 --> 00:50:50.125
Maybe you should go in and lie down.

594
00:50:51.667 --> 00:50:52.667
What was...?

595
00:50:53.208 --> 00:50:54.208
Xian-

596
00:50:54.250 --> 00:50:55.518
rub my temples.

597
00:50:55.542 --> 00:50:57.875
Blanca. has this happened before?

598
00:51:03.750 --> 00:51:05.167
Yuck. so gross.

599
00:51:07.750 --> 00:51:09.750
Honey. I'm okay.

600
00:51:10.458 --> 00:51:11.458
Really?

601
00:51:11.542 --> 00:51:13.643
Blanca. this sudden dizziness. it-

602
00:51:13.667 --> 00:51:14.667
Xu Xian-

603
00:51:14.875 --> 00:51:15.875
what's this?

604
00:51:17.792 --> 00:51:18.958
This?

605
00:51:21.542 --> 00:51:22.726
When I was on the way home

606
00:51:22.750 --> 00:51:25.042
a fortune-teller forced it on me.

607
00:51:25.333 --> 00:51:26.708
<i>Why's</i> it torn in two?

608
00:51:28.042 --> 00:51:29.476
He said I had demons at home.

609
00:51:29.500 --> 00:51:30.792
I ignored him.

610
00:51:32.625 --> 00:51:34.792
What did this fortune-teller look like?

611
00:51:35.208 --> 00:51:36.583
I didn't look that closely

612
00:51:37.625 --> 00:51:40.167
but he had rat-like features.

613
00:51:40.500 --> 00:51:41.583
He looked like a rat.

614
00:51:41.958 --> 00:51:43.625
Blanca. are you feeling better?

615
00:52:57.958 --> 00:52:59.518
Mr Monk!

616
00:52:59.542 --> 00:53:01.934
Yesterday you came after me and I told you

617
00:53:01.958 --> 00:53:04.250
I didn't steal the silver!

618
00:53:04.958 --> 00:53:07.500
You little rat. Sneaky.

619
00:53:07.708 --> 00:53:09.559
Yesterday. you ran away.

620
00:53:09.583 --> 00:53:11.018
But if it wasn't you

621
00:53:11.042 --> 00:53:13.125
then why was a bag of your pills there?

622
00:53:15.667 --> 00:53:18.292
My up dragon recognizes all demons

623
00:53:18.625 --> 00:53:20.750
and followed the scent of the medicine.

624
00:53:21.042 --> 00:53:22.083
He's always right.

625
00:53:22.250 --> 00:53:23.750
It really wasn't me!

626
00:53:24.417 --> 00:53:27.583
I've been framed!

627
00:53:27.750 --> 00:53:28.750
Whatever the case.

628
00:53:29.083 --> 00:53:31.083
you demon. what are you doing here?

629
00:53:31.375 --> 00:53:32.500
You can't be up to any good.

630
00:53:32.958 --> 00:53:34.375
All demons

631
00:53:34.500 --> 00:53:35.833
must be exterminated.

632
00:53:39.250 --> 00:53:40.434
Mr Monk-

633
00:53:40.458 --> 00:53:42.333
there's a demon over there too.

634
00:53:42.500 --> 00:53:44.167
Go get it!

635
00:54:18.042 --> 00:54:19.333
So-a snake demon!

636
00:54:25.083 --> 00:54:26.708
Amitabha.

637
00:54:26.917 --> 00:54:28.500
Cheap tricks.

638
00:55:03.083 --> 00:55:07.000
Hangzhou is full of evil spirits.

639
00:55:13.708 --> 00:55:17.042
Dragon Boat Festival

640
00:55:22.375 --> 00:55:24.083
Go. Brother-in-Law!

641
00:55:28.958 --> 00:55:30.833
Smash it. Brother-in-Law!

642
00:55:49.500 --> 00:55:52.500
Yay!! Well done!

643
00:55:52.667 --> 00:55:55.893
It's decreed that for Dragon Boat Festival

644
00:55:55.917 --> 00:55:59.500
Hangzhou's wine shops will provide

645
00:55:59.917 --> 00:56:01.875
realgar wine in celebration!

646
00:56:19.250 --> 00:56:22.292
Use this realgar to make the wine.

647
00:56:22.458 --> 00:56:24.292
I cast a spell on it

648
00:56:24.542 --> 00:56:25.667
but keep that secret.

649
00:56:25.917 --> 00:56:26.583
Yes-

650
00:56:26.875 --> 00:56:28.768
to rid us of poison and plague

651
00:56:28.792 --> 00:56:31.559
you exhaust yourself yet gain nothing.

652
00:56:31.583 --> 00:56:34.250
Truly a great reverend.

653
00:56:39.583 --> 00:56:41.726
And before you know it

654
00:56:41.750 --> 00:56:43.726
the finish line was in sight

655
00:56:43.750 --> 00:56:45.851
and my drum went boom boom boom.

656
00:56:45.875 --> 00:56:47.393
Even the river dragons

657
00:56:47.417 --> 00:56:48.875
came up for a look.

658
00:56:50.083 --> 00:56:52.934
Do you see how. with the dragons' help.

659
00:56:52.958 --> 00:56:55.934
our boat flew across the finish line.

660
00:56:55.958 --> 00:56:57.518
What a man!

661
00:56:57.542 --> 00:56:59.726
I can see how strong you are!

662
00:56:59.750 --> 00:57:01.851
You are so discerning!

663
00:57:01.875 --> 00:57:03.208
Perceptive too!

664
00:57:03.458 --> 00:57:05.333
Look. the winning dragon boat

665
00:57:05.708 --> 00:57:08.167
gets ten jars of realgar wine.

666
00:57:08.750 --> 00:57:10.625
Drink up. everyone!

667
00:57:11.250 --> 00:57:12.250
A toast!

668
00:57:12.375 --> 00:57:14.518
Verta. have some realgar wine.

669
00:57:14.542 --> 00:57:16.726
It keeps snakes and bugs at bay!

670
00:57:16.750 --> 00:57:17.351
Here!

671
00:57:17.375 --> 00:57:18.375
Not for me!

672
00:57:22.333 --> 00:57:23.934
Sister-in-law!

673
00:57:23.958 --> 00:57:25.018
Our family

674
00:57:25.042 --> 00:57:26.768
owes you so much.

675
00:57:26.792 --> 00:57:28.934
Come. you should drink a bowl.

676
00:57:28.958 --> 00:57:31.542
Yes. Blanca. have a bowl! C'mon!

677
00:57:31.708 --> 00:57:33.268
Blanca. Brother-in-Law

678
00:57:33.292 --> 00:57:34.476
won this wine today as a prize.

679
00:57:34.500 --> 00:57:35.667
Have some!

680
00:57:37.792 --> 00:57:40.750
Sister. this is realgar wine!

681
00:57:41.333 --> 00:57:42.684
I've been practising 1.000 years.

682
00:57:42.708 --> 00:57:44.958
A little bit shouldn't hurt.

683
00:57:47.833 --> 00:57:49.750
Brother-in-law! Husband!

684
00:57:52.583 --> 00:57:53.726
Bravo!

685
00:57:53.750 --> 00:57:54.958
Drink up! C'mon!

686
00:57:59.750 --> 00:58:01.101
- The taste of realgar wine-
- Come. Blanca.

687
00:58:01.125 --> 00:58:02.333
It doesn't appeal to me.

688
00:58:02.458 --> 00:58:03.227
I'll use almond flower wine!

689
00:58:03.251 --> 00:58:05.208
Let's sit down. Here.

690
00:58:05.958 --> 00:58:06.958
Bottoms up!

691
00:58:11.375 --> 00:58:13.708
Brother-in-law. you call that drinking?

692
00:58:13.958 --> 00:58:15.708
Bravo!

693
00:58:27.167 --> 00:58:28.167
Husband-

694
00:58:28.292 --> 00:58:30.625
I feel faint. I'm going home.

695
00:58:31.042 --> 00:58:32.292
Blanca. are you alright?

696
00:58:32.542 --> 00:58:33.542
I'm okay.

697
00:58:33.792 --> 00:58:35.393
Stay with Verta and Brother-in-Law

698
00:58:35.417 --> 00:58:36.708
and enjoy the drinking.

699
00:58:38.417 --> 00:58:40.542
Alright. I'll see you later.

700
00:59:04.167 --> 00:59:05.144
Let's go. sister-in-law.

701
00:59:05.168 --> 00:59:07.434
Let's go to Houchao Gate

702
00:59:07.458 --> 00:59:08.958
and catch some shows.

703
00:59:09.292 --> 00:59:11.476
Little bro. come with us!

704
00:59:11.500 --> 00:59:12.477
You go.

705
00:59:12.501 --> 00:59:14.333
I'd better go look after my wife.

706
00:59:15.542 --> 00:59:17.958
Go then. Newly-weds!

707
00:59:18.375 --> 00:59:20.101
Sister-in-law. come with me?

708
00:59:20.125 --> 00:59:21.292
Sure.

709
00:59:21.958 --> 00:59:25.434
A lotus bath. sweet flag flower brew

710
00:59:25.458 --> 00:59:27.917
And gentle sunlight too.

711
00:59:30.333 --> 00:59:31.333
Blanca?

712
00:59:33.958 --> 00:59:35.250
Blanca?

713
00:59:37.292 --> 00:59:38.292
Blanca?

714
00:59:41.542 --> 00:59:42.625
She's not here?

715
00:59:47.333 --> 00:59:48.792
What if she fell in?

716
00:59:49.792 --> 00:59:50.792
Blanca!

717
00:59:51.000 --> 00:59:52.208
Blanca!

718
00:59:54.500 --> 00:59:55.917
Where are you?

719
00:59:57.583 --> 00:59:58.833
Blanca!

720
01:00:00.333 --> 01:00:01.333
Xian!

721
01:00:05.958 --> 01:00:07.125
Blanca!

722
01:00:07.750 --> 01:00:08.958
Xian!

723
01:00:10.042 --> 01:00:11.250
Xian!

724
01:00:12.833 --> 01:00:14.708
Xian!

725
01:00:20.417 --> 01:00:21.792
Xian!

726
01:00:49.792 --> 01:00:51.000
Xian!

727
01:00:52.875 --> 01:00:54.042
Xian!

728
01:00:55.958 --> 01:00:56.958
Xian!

729
01:00:58.750 --> 01:00:59.750
Xian!

730
01:01:06.833 --> 01:01:07.833
Xian!

731
01:01:08.958 --> 01:01:11.184
Verta!

732
01:01:11.208 --> 01:01:13.542
His pulse is weak. I can't save him.

733
01:01:13.792 --> 01:01:15.333
Hurry. help me!

734
01:01:16.542 --> 01:01:19.250
Verta. where are you?

735
01:01:20.583 --> 01:01:21.833
Xian!

736
01:01:23.375 --> 01:01:24.500
Xian!

737
01:01:24.833 --> 01:01:26.167
Miss!

738
01:01:26.583 --> 01:01:28.976
It's Hangzhou's top opera troupe!

739
01:01:29.000 --> 01:01:31.333
Precious Jade Workshop of Sandskin Lane.

740
01:01:32.583 --> 01:01:36.726
Revive-the-dead hocus pocus

741
01:01:36.750 --> 01:01:39.208
is the sort of job we love.

742
01:01:40.000 --> 01:01:41.000
Precious Jade Workshop!

743
01:01:41.500 --> 01:01:42.833
Precious Jade Workshop!

744
01:01:53.542 --> 01:01:55.167
Boss!

745
01:02:12.000 --> 01:02:13.000
Boss!

746
01:02:13.083 --> 01:02:14.083
Boss!

747
01:02:15.542 --> 01:02:16.542
Boss!

748
01:02:30.625 --> 01:02:31.625
Cloak...

749
01:02:32.833 --> 01:02:33.833
Pretty woman...

750
01:02:36.250 --> 01:02:37.250
Woman warrior...

751
01:02:39.375 --> 01:02:42.292
You want to save your husband-

752
01:02:43.208 --> 01:02:45.250
hard and yet not hard.

753
01:02:45.958 --> 01:02:47.601
The not hard part

754
01:02:47.625 --> 01:02:50.375
is that I know how to save him.

755
01:02:50.750 --> 01:02:53.101
Besides. you paid upfront

756
01:02:53.125 --> 01:02:56.583
with a precious snake scale.

757
01:02:57.292 --> 01:02:59.434
The hard part is yours.

758
01:02:59.458 --> 01:03:00.875
Your husband-

759
01:03:01.375 --> 01:03:05.059
a mortal-saw your true face

760
01:03:05.083 --> 01:03:07.768
and his spirit fled in fright.

761
01:03:07.792 --> 01:03:09.518
What remains

762
01:03:09.542 --> 01:03:11.833
is seeping away.

763
01:03:12.625 --> 01:03:15.226
Such a faint-hearted soul-

764
01:03:15.250 --> 01:03:18.018
how's that going to work out for you?

765
01:03:18.042 --> 01:03:19.958
It was my fault. not his.

766
01:03:20.000 --> 01:03:21.750
I'll be more careful from now on.

767
01:03:22.250 --> 01:03:23.292
Mortals

768
01:03:23.750 --> 01:03:24.750
and demons-

769
01:03:25.000 --> 01:03:27.250
not a natural pairing.

770
01:03:27.958 --> 01:03:30.518
I fear future hardships

771
01:03:30.542 --> 01:03:32.559
will be endless for you.

772
01:03:32.583 --> 01:03:34.184
The future's the future.

773
01:03:34.208 --> 01:03:35.500
Please save him!

774
01:03:38.250 --> 01:03:40.583
Given our 500-year karmic connection...

775
01:03:40.833 --> 01:03:42.125
Come with me!

776
01:03:47.208 --> 01:03:49.875
There's a fairy grass that'll save him.

777
01:03:50.125 --> 01:03:52.351
It grows on a steep cliff

778
01:03:52.375 --> 01:03:54.375
in a cold place in the Northwest.

779
01:03:54.750 --> 01:03:56.167
Mt Kunlun.

780
01:03:56.292 --> 01:03:57.500
Mt Kunlun?

781
01:03:58.708 --> 01:03:59.708
Yes.

782
01:04:00.250 --> 01:04:03.250
Reviving such an unexceptional mortal is easy.

783
01:04:04.750 --> 01:04:08.476
Just pick some fairy grass on Kunlun

784
01:04:08.500 --> 01:04:09.792
and he'll be saved.

785
01:04:10.708 --> 01:04:12.059
But to get there

786
01:04:12.083 --> 01:04:13.101
is a journey

787
01:04:13.125 --> 01:04:14.893
of three days and nights.

788
01:04:14.917 --> 01:04:16.292
In the state he's in...

789
01:04:17.542 --> 01:04:18.583
Found it!

790
01:04:21.042 --> 01:04:22.583
It's this thing-

791
01:04:22.958 --> 01:04:24.958
this incense burner.

792
01:04:27.583 --> 01:04:29.792
See the tip of the burner?

793
01:04:30.042 --> 01:04:32.125
That's Mt Kunlun.

794
01:04:33.750 --> 01:04:37.958
I'll light this incense and send you there.

795
01:04:40.583 --> 01:04:43.934
Where's the jade hairpin I made you?

796
01:04:43.958 --> 01:04:46.542
Why aren't you wearing it?

797
01:04:47.000 --> 01:04:51.042
Mt Kunlun is a very dangerous place.

798
01:04:51.542 --> 01:04:53.226
Never mind.

799
01:04:53.250 --> 01:04:56.143
As part of the deal. I'll throw in

800
01:04:56.167 --> 01:04:57.708
a pair of swords.

801
01:05:04.542 --> 01:05:06.226
You must return

802
01:05:06.250 --> 01:05:08.726
before the incense burns down.

803
01:05:08.750 --> 01:05:12.268
Once it's out. the road is cut.

804
01:05:12.292 --> 01:05:14.250
Hurry there and back.

805
01:05:15.083 --> 01:05:16.333
Go!

806
01:05:39.958 --> 01:05:41.726
To save my husband

807
01:05:41.750 --> 01:05:43.500
I need fairy grass.

808
01:05:45.792 --> 01:05:47.208
Mountain gods. have mercy.

809
01:06:13.250 --> 01:06:14.708
You demon!

810
01:06:14.958 --> 01:06:18.125
How dare you come to Kunlun for fairy grass?

811
01:06:18.250 --> 01:06:20.559
You think you can just come

812
01:06:20.583 --> 01:06:22.018
and go as you please?

813
01:06:22.042 --> 01:06:25.458
Right?

814
01:06:27.083 --> 01:06:28.060
Lil' Bro-

815
01:06:28.084 --> 01:06:29.458
that "right" was a bit off.

816
01:06:30.000 --> 01:06:33.018
You need to convey authority.

817
01:06:33.042 --> 01:06:34.226
That be like-

818
01:06:34.250 --> 01:06:36.309
"Right?"

819
01:06:36.333 --> 01:06:37.726
Stress. rise.

820
01:06:37.750 --> 01:06:39.018
cut.

821
01:06:39.042 --> 01:06:40.684
"Right..."?

822
01:06:40.708 --> 01:06:43.434
Big Bro. that sound of mine-

823
01:06:43.458 --> 01:06:45.059
light and long

824
01:06:45.083 --> 01:06:47.268
is for mockery.

825
01:06:47.292 --> 01:06:49.518
Right?

826
01:06:49.542 --> 01:06:50.934
No.

827
01:06:50.958 --> 01:06:54.101
No idea who she is. so why the scorn?

828
01:06:54.125 --> 01:06:56.250
Lil' bro. don't underestimate the enemy.

829
01:06:56.583 --> 01:06:57.227
Big Bro-

830
01:06:57.251 --> 01:07:01.750
There's purpose to my mockery.

831
01:07:02.208 --> 01:07:03.292
Where'd she go?

832
01:07:05.750 --> 01:07:07.292
The demon fled!

833
01:07:09.750 --> 01:07:12.083
Don't run. demon!

834
01:07:26.250 --> 01:07:27.750
Cut her off.

835
01:07:52.083 --> 01:07:53.226
So she was a snake demon.

836
01:07:53.250 --> 01:07:55.768
Cranes eat snakes. right?

837
01:07:55.792 --> 01:07:58.059
Little Bro. wrong again.

838
01:07:58.083 --> 01:07:59.559
All creatures eat and are eaten.

839
01:07:59.583 --> 01:08:01.268
We don't just eat snakes.

840
01:08:01.292 --> 01:08:03.750
So snakes eat cranes?

841
01:08:04.542 --> 01:08:07.958
Not exactly true either.

842
01:08:37.625 --> 01:08:38.394
Cripes!

843
01:08:38.418 --> 01:08:40.667
It's the Kunlun Crane Twins!

844
01:08:51.750 --> 01:08:54.875
Demon. you won't get away!

845
01:09:24.250 --> 01:09:24.977
Xian!

846
01:09:25.001 --> 01:09:27.809
He lives. Pal-

847
01:09:27.833 --> 01:09:31.059
we've got a new business deal.

848
01:09:31.083 --> 01:09:34.000
In the future. if you run into trouble

849
01:09:34.500 --> 01:09:38.018
come to Precious Jade Workshop.

850
01:09:38.042 --> 01:09:40.208
What's this about?

851
01:09:42.250 --> 01:09:44.042
He's still recovering.

852
01:09:44.750 --> 01:09:46.250
Let him sleep.

853
01:09:51.958 --> 01:09:52.958
Blanca!

854
01:09:54.208 --> 01:09:55.208
Blanca!

855
01:09:55.292 --> 01:09:56.750
Xian. are you okay?

856
01:09:56.958 --> 01:09:57.958
Blanca-

857
01:09:58.333 --> 01:10:00.750
I was in the strangest place just now.

858
01:10:01.250 --> 01:10:02.500
You were there.

859
01:10:03.500 --> 01:10:05.380
And the singer from Precious Jade Workshop too.

860
01:10:06.125 --> 01:10:07.542
You were dreaming.

861
01:10:08.500 --> 01:10:09.500
Dreaming...

862
01:10:12.250 --> 01:10:13.792
Have some water.

863
01:10:16.625 --> 01:10:17.917
That giant snake last night!

864
01:10:18.125 --> 01:10:18.727
Blanca-

865
01:10:18.751 --> 01:10:20.458
there's a giant snake in our pond.

866
01:10:20.708 --> 01:10:22.000
A huge one. for real.

867
01:10:23.250 --> 01:10:24.476
It's okay.

868
01:10:24.500 --> 01:10:25.518
It was just a dream.

869
01:10:25.542 --> 01:10:26.559
It was no dream.

870
01:10:26.583 --> 01:10:27.227
It was real. Blanca.

871
01:10:27.251 --> 01:10:28.458
It was in the pond.

